      "delta": "BYOK S2a: injected spawn and explicit filtered env; caller-selected sandbox (danger-full-access default, inherit passes no override); raw AdapterSession without sealSession/input-images; native-first frame capture with visible fold failure/kill; bounded server request decline/reject using 0.159.2 response schemas; ES2022 deferred Promise. S2b: explicit body.origin=byok-native; inject required consumer/budget before registration. Re-vendor: remove capabilities.steer; refine optional generic steer to a required Codex method; no withdraw or derived deliver. Native interactions: explicit on-request policy with readback, opt-in caller-owned request lifecycle, one-shot typed replies and local cancellation records; no fallback allow or persistence. Native replies await acknowledged stdin writes under bounded ownership. 0.33.1 re-vendor: build the open request before the owned spawn and pass its redactor to the client."
